+nav_on=0/1 preserves the old layout. nav_on=2 stores raw NO_VIEWS.
+Raw views must be a multiple of ETL+1. The first shot is the volume
+navigator train, followed by imaging shots. Every shot has ETL echoes
+and one final PE=0 navigator echo. Slice/diffusion/average ordering
+is inherited. Runtime no_views is reduced to shots*ETL only after
+validation; the embedded protocol still records the full raw count.
+The imaging centric centre stays echo 1; appended echo costs one ESP.
+3D is compiled out to keep this image within the v1.8 relative budget.
 
